your unexpected,

7
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:10,500
イジワルな人
teasing remark.

8
00:04:10,500 --> 00:04:13,500
「いつもよりカッコいいかも
"Maybe you look cooler than usual!

9
00:04:13,500 --> 00:04:16,000
気のせいですか？」
Is it just my imagination?"

10
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:19,500
二人は笑う
The two of us laugh.

11
00:04:19,500 --> 00:04:25,000
紹介したい人がいます
There's someone I want to introduce to you,

12
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:30,000
パパと同じ負けず嫌い
just as stubborn as my dad.

13
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:32,800
涙もろく
A crybaby,

14
00:04:32,800 --> 00:04:34,500
よく笑う
who laughs a lot,

15
00:04:34,500 --> 00:04:37,000
優しい人なんです
a kind person.

16
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:40,500
歩いてもいいですか？
Is it okay if we walk together?

17
00:04:40,500 --> 00:04:43,500
「エスコートしてよね」
"Escort me, okay?"

18
00:04:43,500 --> 00:04:45,500
君はナイト
You are my knight,

19
00:04:45,500 --> 00:04:48,000
離さないでね
don't ever let go.

20
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:53,000
世界一の愛をあげる
I'll give you the greatest love in the world.

21
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:55,500
ケンカしても
Even when we fight,

22
00:04:55,500 --> 00:04:58,000
落ち込んでても
even when we're down,

23
00:04:58,000 --> 00:05:00,000
君の味方
I'm on your side.

24
00:05:00,208 --> 00:05:02,308
愛に出会う
Meeting love,

25
00:05:02,508 --> 00:05:04,508
君がいるなら
if you're here,

26
00:05:04,808 --> 00:05:07,508
恋は続く
love continues.

27
00:05:17,808 --> 00:05:21,508
運命の人は来る日
The day my destined person comes,

28
00:05:21,808 --> 00:05:26,508
白馬に乗ってやって来ました
he arrived riding a white horse.

29
00:05:27,508 --> 00:05:30,808
現実はそうじゃないけど
Reality isn't quite like that, but...

30
00:05:31,008 --> 00:05:36,008
普通の君が一番好きよ
I love the ordinary you best.

31
00:05:37,008 --> 00:05:39,808
紹介したい人が居ます
There's someone I want to introduce.

32
00:05:40,008 --> 00:05:43,808
うつむいた 慣れない君
